Dialogue: 3,0:00:21.14,0:00:24.27,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,120)}我闪闪发光
Dialogue: 3,0:00:26.36,0:00:27.27,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)}抬起头看看吧
