Dialogue: 2,0:00:21.14,0:00:24.27,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,120)}私は煌めく
Dialogue: 2,0:00:26.36,0:00:27.27,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)}見上げてごらん
