Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.30,0:22:06.85,ED - CN - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}总是顾及别人的视线
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.85,0:22:09.74,ED - CN - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}不停地  不停地
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.74,0:22:12.23,ED - CN - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}在自己身上涂改
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.23,0:22:15.36,ED - CN - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}将自己的名字刻在心里
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.36,0:22:19.40,ED - CN - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}将那个不能做自己的我
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.56,0:22:25.66,ED - CN - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur5}留在过去
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.20,0:22:32.01,ED - CN - Shad,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5\fs55}我要做我自己
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.01,0:22:34.33,ED - CN - Shad,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5\fs55}跨越每一片大海  自由地奔跑
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.33,0:22:37.47,ED - CN - Shad,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5\fs55}离开这逼仄的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.47,0:22:43.43,ED - CN - Shad,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,500)\blur5\fs55}渴求着爱而颤抖着的心
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.55,0:22:47.55,ED - CN - Shad,,0,0,3,,{\fad(500,500)\blur5\fs55}将因照耀着明日的你
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.25,0:22:50.60,ED - CN - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}而熠熠生辉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.52,0:23:01.28,ED - CN - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur5}我也一定会是某个人的光
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.31,0:21:41.24,ED - JP - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur5}私は私のままで良いかな？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.49,0:21:42.93,ED - JP - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}愛されたい
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.93,0:21:49.34,ED - JP - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur5}自分の知る世界を手放しても
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.81,0:21:53.03,ED - JP - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}ほかの人と we never pieced together
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.03,0:21:55.84,ED - JP - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}伝えても通じ合えない
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.84,0:21:58.81,ED - JP - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}「普通」に馴染めなくて
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.81,0:22:01.09,ED - JP - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur5}居場所さえない
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.22,0:22:04.30,ED - JP - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,300)\blur5}分かち合う人いなくて
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.30,0:22:06.85,ED - JP - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}視線ばかり気にして
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.85,0:22:09.74,ED - JP - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}ずっとずっと自分を
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.74,0:22:12.23,ED - JP - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}書き換えていた
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.23,0:22:15.36,ED - JP - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}I write my name　刻んで
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.36,0:22:19.40,ED - JP - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}ありのままじゃない自分を
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.56,0:22:25.66,ED - JP - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur5}もう過去に置いてく
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.20,0:22:32.01,ED - JP - Shad,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5\fs60}私は私のままでいたい
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.01,0:22:34.33,ED - JP - Shad,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5\fs60}Crossing every sea, running free
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.33,0:22:37.47,ED - JP - Shad,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5\fs60}狭い世界離れて
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.47,0:22:43.43,ED - JP - Shad,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,500)\blur5\fs60}愛されたくて　ふるえる心は
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.55,0:22:47.55,ED - JP - Shad,,0,0,3,,{\fad(500,500)\blur5\fs60}明日を照らす君だけの
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.25,0:22:50.60,ED - JP - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}it's your wild glow
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.52,0:23:01.28,ED - JP - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur5}きっと誰かの光だから
